---
layout: base.njk
---
{#
  Home page layout. The prose (headline + tagline) comes from index.md so it
  can be edited as Markdown; the project cards are generated from the
  case-study front matter and so live here, in the template.
#}
<section class="hero">
  {{ content | safe }}
</section>

<section class="work-list">
  <h2>Selected work</h2>
  {%- for project in collections.work | sort(false, false, 'data.order') %}
  <a href="{{ project.url }}" class="work-card">
    <div class="work-card-text">
      <h3>{{ project.data.title }}</h3>
      <p>{{ project.data.description }}</p>
      <span class="work-card-meta">{{ project.data.role }} · {{ project.data.timeline }}</span>
    </div>
  </a>
  {%- endfor %}
</section>
